# MobX controllers

```dart
// ✅ existing pattern
class FooScreenController = FooScreenControllerBase with _$FooScreenController;

abstract class FooScreenControllerBase with Store {
  // optional repo + @visibleForTesting fetch overrides
  @observable
  AsyncValue<T> data = const AsyncValue.loading();

  @action
  Future<void> load() async { /* … */ }
}
```

- Keep `part '….g.dart';` next to the controller; regenerate after `@observable` / `@action` / `@computed` changes.
- Prefer `AsyncValue` / existing helpers (`async_load_helper`, `mobx_async_value`) over ad-hoc loading flags.
- Expose test seams via `@visibleForTesting` callbacks or injectable repositories — do not reach into private network code from tests.
- Controllers orchestrate state; parsing and HTTP live in repositories / models.
